cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Zij or its harmonized fire record, please cite it as below, and credit NASA FIRMS for the fire detections."
type: software
title: "Zij: one fire record from NASA's MODIS and VIIRS, 2000 to now"
abstract: >-
  Zij puts NASA's two satellite fire records, MODIS since 2000 and VIIRS since 2012, on one scale.
  It counts both in one unit, converts MODIS to VIIRS-equivalent values with a model fitted and
  validated on the years both sensors flew, gives every converted value a band, and lets anyone
  explore the record for preset areas or for an area they draw.
authors:
